    {
      "title": "Next.js Project Setup Overview",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Next.js Project Setup Overview",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What create-next-app Does",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==create-next-app== is the official **scaffolder**",
                "Generates `package.json`, config files, starter `app/`",
                "Then ==installs dependencies=="
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "cards",
              "spec": {
                "cards": [
                  {
                    "title": "app/",
                    "lines": [
                      "routes and UI"
                    ],
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "next.config",
                    "lines": [
                      "framework behaviour"
                    ],
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "tsconfig.json",
                    "lines": [
                      "types and aliases"
                    ],
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "title": ".env*",
                    "lines": [
                      "runtime values"
                    ],
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Mental Model",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "The ==folder tree under app/== IS the routing table",
                "Config files only **tune** how it is built and served",
                "{red:Never} read non-public env vars in Client Components"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Scripts",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Script",
                "Does"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`npm run dev`",
                  "hot-reload server"
                ],
                [
                  "`npm run build`",
                  "production build"
                ],
                [
                  "`npm run start`",
                  "serves the build"
                ],
                [
                  "`npm run lint`",
                  "runs ESLint"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Generates?** package.json, configs, starter app/; app/ routes, next.config builds",
                "**Why folders?** Each folder is a URL segment; page.tsx makes it public",
                "**dev/build/start?** Hot reload; compile for production; serve that build"
              ],
              "style": "star"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Order",
              "text": "`start` serves what `build` produced, so run ==build first==."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Running create-next-app",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Running create-next-app",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Scaffold",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "No name or flags → ==interactive prompts==",
                "Covers TypeScript, ESLint, Tailwind, `src/`, App Router, alias (default `@/*`)",
                "Package manager flag sets the ==installer== and the lockfile"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "lines": [
                "npx create-next-app@latest my-app",
                "npx create-next-app@latest my-app --ts --eslint --tailwind --src-dir --app --import-alias \"@/*\" --use-pnpm"
              ],
              "note": "Line 2 skips every prompt; --js replaces --ts"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Flag",
                "Lockfile"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`--use-npm`",
                  "package-lock.json"
                ],
                [
                  "`--use-pnpm`",
                  "pnpm-lock.yaml"
                ],
                [
                  "`--use-yarn`",
                  "yarn.lock"
                ],
                [
                  "`--use-bun`",
                  "bun.lock"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Run and mistakes",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "lines": [
                "cd my-app && npm run dev",
                "npm run dev -- -p 4000"
              ],
              "note": "Serves on http://localhost:3000; -p changes the port"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Mistakes",
              "text": "Name must be ==lowercase== and npm-safe. A non-empty folder with conflicting files fails or overwrites."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**What does it do?** Generates package.json, config, starter `app/`, installs deps; flags skip prompts",
                "**What does `--src-dir` change?** `app/` moves to `src/app/`; configs stay at root",
                "**Which port?** ==3000==; `-p 4000` changes it"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "App Directory Structure",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "App Directory Structure",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Routes and Special Files",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`app/` is the ==App Router root==: each folder is a **URL segment**",
                "Public only with ==page.tsx== or ==route.ts==",
                "`public/logo.png` is served at `/logo.png`",
                "Optional `src/` holds `app/`; configs stay at the root"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "File",
                "Role"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`layout.tsx`",
                  "Shared shell, persists"
                ],
                [
                  "`page.tsx`",
                  "Route UI"
                ],
                [
                  "`loading.tsx`",
                  "Suspense fallback"
                ],
                [
                  "`error.tsx`",
                  "Error boundary, **Client Component**"
                ],
                [
                  "`not-found.tsx`",
                  "404 UI"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Organising Folders",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Folder",
                "Effect",
                "URL"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`(shop)`",
                  "Grouping only",
                  "not in URL"
                ],
                [
                  "`_lib`",
                  "Private, opts out of routing",
                  "none"
                ],
                [
                  "`[slug]`",
                  "Dynamic segment",
                  "`/blog/hello`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes and Interview Point",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Root layout",
              "text": "`app/layout.tsx` is ==required== and must render `<html>` and `<body>`. A folder with no `page.tsx` returns **404**, even with components."
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Public route?** `page.tsx` or `route.ts`",
                "**Group vs private?** `(group)` is routed but hidden from the URL; `_private` is not routed",
                "**Why a root layout?** It wraps every page and renders `<html>`, `<body>`"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "next.config, TypeScript and Path Aliases",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "next.config, TypeScript and Path Aliases",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. next.config",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==next.config.ts== (or .js/.mjs) at the project root",
                "Exports an object typed `NextConfig`",
                "Read at server start: ==restart== the dev server"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "ts",
              "lines": [
                "import type { NextConfig } from 'next'",
                "const config: NextConfig = {",
                "  typedRoutes: true,",
                "  output: 'standalone',",
                "  images: { remotePatterns: [{ hostname: 'cdn.site.com' }] },",
                "}",
                "export default config"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Option",
                "Use"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`images.remotePatterns`",
                  "allow external image hosts"
                ],
                [
                  "`redirects()` / `rewrites()`",
                  "async, return arrays"
                ],
                [
                  "`output: 'standalone'`",
                  "self-contained Docker build"
                ],
                [
                  "`env`, `reactStrictMode`",
                  "inline values, extra dev checks"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. TypeScript and Aliases",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`tsconfig.json`: ==strict: true== plus the Next.js plugin",
                "`next-env.d.ts`: auto-generated, never edit, keep in .gitignore",
                "==typedRoutes== makes `Link` href and `router.push` reject unknown paths",
                "Alias lets you write `import { Button } from '@/components/Button'`"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "json",
              "lines": [
                "\"paths\": {",
                "  \"@/*\": [\"./src/*\"]",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "tsconfig compilerOptions"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Mistakes",
              "text": "Paths must match the ==real folders== or imports break. Edit next.config without a restart and it looks like **nothing changed**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "ESLint and Environment Variables",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "ESLint and Environment Variables",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. ESLint Setup",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`eslint.config.mjs` is the ==flat config==; run `npm run lint`",
                "Extends ==next/core-web-vitals==: `no-img-element`, `no-html-link-for-pages`",
                "Add ==next/typescript== for TS rules",
                "Lints `app`, `pages`, `components`, `src` by default"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "javascript",
              "lines": [
                "...compat.extends(\"next/core-web-vitals\", \"next/typescript\")"
              ],
              "note": "extends list"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Env Files and Exposure",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Priority",
                "File",
                "Use"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "1",
                  "process env",
                  "shell or host"
                ],
                [
                  "2",
                  "`.env.$(NODE_ENV).local`",
                  "local, per mode"
                ],
                [
                  "3",
                  "`.env.local`",
                  "secrets, git-ignored, skipped in test"
                ],
                [
                  "4",
                  "`.env.$(NODE_ENV)`",
                  "development or production"
                ],
                [
                  "5",
                  "`.env`",
                  "all environments"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`.env.test` is for tests only",
                "No prefix: ==server only==",
                "`NEXT_PUBLIC_`: ==inlined at build time==, so rebuild after changes"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Secret in `NEXT_PUBLIC_` is exposed to every visitor",
                "Committing `.env.local` leaks credentials",
                "Dynamic `process.env[name]` in client code is not inlined",
                "Plain variable in a Client Component still prints into SSR HTML"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Read secrets only in **server code**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Setup Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
